    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just frustrating because even when i follow the feeding schedule perfectly, it's like something is sabotaging it. one day it's fine, and the next it's just... chaotic. i'm wondering if there's any way these microbes could be reacting to something in the environment that's too small to measure with my current equipment. like, is there any way the community of microbes itself becomes \"unruly\" or unpredictable even under controlled conditions?",
